// Test: bugfixes/validate_match_unknown_pattern_is_sem010
// Grammar: validate_match, validate_pattern_name
// Semantic: SEM010 — an unknown pattern name in a `validate` block `match:`
//   constraint is SEM010, the same code as an unknown `.matches()` pattern
//   (spec decision 2026-11-27, round 5)
